{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/GIF_title.gif?t=1751427661\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Second Installment of <strong><i>(The Lingering)</i></strong> Series. <strong>Welcome to <i>(The Lingering) Graveyard Visit.</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>(The Lingering)</strong></i> is an episodic atmospheric horror series, inspired by <strong>true horror events</strong> and <strong>urban legends in Indonesia</strong>. Each episode tells the unsettling stories of those who cross paths with the lingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/GIF_hero.gif?t=1751427661\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i><strong>(The Lingering) Graveyard Visit</strong></i>, play as <strong>Eki</strong>, an 11-year-old boy visiting his late father\u2019s grave with his mother. There, he meets <strong>Tomy</strong>, a local boy who seems to know a lot about the village, including the dark rumors surrounding the sacrificial ritual, a wealth-seeking ritual said to involve sacrificing a child\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Haunted by doubt, Eki begins to suspect that this graveyard visit might be somewhat related to the ritual, especially knowing his mother has been struggling financially since his father\u2019s death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Narrative-driven, walking-sim, atmospheric horror set in Indonesian graveyard.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3731150/extras/GIF_key_features.gif?t=1751427661\" /></div></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Narrative-driven exploration</strong><br>Join Eki\u2019s journey throughout the graveyard visit. Enjoy the story to unveil the mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Set in authentic Indonesian graveyard</strong><br>Explore the atmospheric Indonesian graveyard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Retro PSX Graphic Style </strong> <br> A chilling blend of <strong><i>nostalgic aesthetics</i></strong> and <strong><i>modern horror storytelling</i></strong>, bringing the eerie world to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A Twist In the Story</strong>  <br>The graveyard buried a deep dark secret, join Eki\u2019s journey to reveal it.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Missing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/dbb51a3266f59721951145ea28671ab6a471511d.jpg"},{"name":"Under Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/80ad9aa851d3df5a606415ea030a64ab83f2b497.jpg"},{"name":"Something's Wrong","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/1013a54de3bbbf442b2de2ef3004dc6d74889361.jpg"},{"name":"Caught in Action","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/a229de4db4cd6992c4599c74e75aa4d852db8e83.jpg"},{"name":"Repeating Mistakes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/8655e1588463984850bfcff5fb9cf1f5044baf19.jpg"},{"name":"Finally, the Truth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/01f6aa8bed77756a4267bacf90ac067efc9d65be.jpg"},{"name":"Detour","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/37ac276d34705580c4f0441d1ea970424ad06321.jpg"},{"name":"Town Gossip","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3731150/a679a0f5e8358edd923d3a1fa726fced7cba11f8.jpg"},{"name":"The Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/ima